{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# Agentforce Architecture\n## Agentforce Service Agent\n\nThree-tier platform: **Service Cloud** (channels) → **Agentforce Core Platform** (build & run) → **Data Cloud** (grounding & memory). External Salesforce orgs and third-party systems feed Data Cloud via Ingestion API.","x":-200,"y":-320,"width":1600,"height":120,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"legend","type":"text","text":"**Legend**\n- Pink / red group = Service Cloud\n- Blue group = Agentforce Core Platform\n- Purple group = Data Cloud\n- Grey group = External LLMs (BYO LLM)\n- Bottom row = Source systems feeding Data Cloud","x":1520,"y":-320,"width":380,"height":120,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"g_service","type":"group","x":-200,"y":-160,"width":520,"height":680,"color":"1","label":"Service Cloud"},
		{"id":"n_digital_engagement","type":"text","text":"## Digital Engagement\n\n- Enhanced: SMS, FB, WhatsApp, Apple\n- MIAW (Messaging for In-App & Web)\n\n[→ Salesforce Help: Digital Engagement](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.messaging_intro.htm&type=5)","x":-180,"y":-140,"width":240,"height":200},
		{"id":"n_bots_agents","type":"text","text":"## Bots / Agents\n\nEinstein Bots and Agentforce agents handle automated customer conversations\n\n[→ Agentforce vs Einstein Bots](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/agentforce-service-agent-quick-look)","x":-180,"y":80,"width":240,"height":160},
		{"id":"n_service_console","type":"text","text":"## Lightning Console\n\nAgent desktop for human supervisors and escalation\n\n[→ Salesforce Help: Service Console](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.console2_overview.htm&type=5)","x":80,"y":-140,"width":220,"height":160},
		{"id":"n_omnichannel","type":"text","text":"## Omnichannel\n\nRoutes work across channels and queues to the right agent\n\n[→ Salesforce Help: Omni-Channel](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.omnichannel_intro.htm&type=5)","x":80,"y":40,"width":220,"height":160},
		{"id":"n_omniflow","type":"text","text":"## Omni-Flow\n\nFlow-based routing logic for Omni-Channel work item distribution\n\n[→ Salesforce Help: Omni-Flow](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.omnichannel_flow_overview.htm&type=5)","x":80,"y":220,"width":220,"height":140},
		{"id":"g_platform","type":"group","x":360,"y":-160,"width":1120,"height":680,"color":"3","label":"Agentforce Core Platform"},
		{"id":"g_agent_builder","type":"group","x":380,"y":-140,"width":320,"height":380,"color":"3","label":"Agent Builder"},
		{"id":"n_agent_builder","type":"text","text":"## [Agent Builder](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=ai.agentforce_build.htm&type=5)\n\nLow-code UI to configure agents, topics, and actions.\n\n- **General Setup** — system prompt, channels, running user\n- **Topics** — define intent domains and instructions\n- **Actions** — attach Apex, Flow, Prompt Templates\n  - Action types: Apex · Flow · Prompt Template\n\n[→ Trailhead: Agentforce Builder Basics](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/agent-builder-basics)\n[→ Trailhead: Intro to Builder](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/introduction-to-agentforce-builder)","x":390,"y":-120,"width":300,"height":340},
		{"id":"g_prompt_builder","type":"group","x":720,"y":-140,"width":440,"height":620,"color":"3","label":"Prompt Builder"},
		{"id":"n_prompt_templates","type":"text","text":"## [Prompt Templates](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=ai.prompt_builder_about.htm&type=5)\n\nCustomer Product Usage includes `{!FlowName}` or `{!Apex}` merge fields\n\n[→ Trailhead: Prompt Builder Basics](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/prompt-builder-basics)","x":730,"y":-120,"width":420,"height":140},
		{"id":"n_grounding","type":"text","text":"## [Grounding Options (RAG)](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=ai.prompt_builder_grounding_options.htm&type=5)\n\n- **Apex** — custom logic retrievers\n- **Flow** — declarative data fetch\n- **Unstructured Data** (No Code Retrievers) — Einstein Data Library\n- **DMO** — Data Model Objects from Data Cloud\n- **CRM Records** — live Salesforce record data\n- **Record Snapshots** — point-in-time CRM data\n- **Related List** — child records on a context record\n\n[→ Trailhead: Data Grounding and RAG](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/data-cloud-powered-agentforce)\n[→ RAG Best Practices](https://www.salesforce.com/agentforce/agentforce-and-rag/)","x":730,"y":40,"width":420,"height":420},
		{"id":"g_einstein_studio","type":"group","x":1180,"y":-140,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"3","label":"Einstein Studio"},
		{"id":"n_einstein_studio","type":"text","text":"## [Einstein Studio](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.einstein_studio_overview.htm&type=5)\n\n- **Models** — bring external models or use standard Salesforce AI models\n- **Retrievers** — connect vector search indexes for RAG\n\n[→ Salesforce Help: Einstein Studio](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.einstein_studio_overview.htm&type=5)","x":1190,"y":-120,"width":260,"height":200},
		{"id":"g_data_library","type":"group","x":1180,"y":120,"width":280,"height":260,"color":"3","label":"Einstein Data Library"},
		{"id":"n_data_library","type":"text","text":"## [Einstein Data Library](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=ai.agentforce_data_library.htm&type=5)\n\n- **Files** — indexed unstructured documents (PDF, DOCX, etc.)\n- **Knowledge** — Salesforce Knowledge articles\n\n[→ Trailhead: Agentforce Data Library Basics](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/agentforce-data-library-basics)","x":1190,"y":140,"width":260,"height":220},
		{"id":"g_trust_layer","type":"group","x":1480,"y":-140,"width":280,"height":680,"color":"1","label":"Einstein Trust Layer"},
		{"id":"n_trust_layer","type":"text","text":"## [Einstein Trust Layer](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.einstein_trust_layer_intro.htm&type=5)\n\nLLM Gateway — all LLM calls pass through the Trust Layer:\n\n- Zero data retention with LLM providers\n- Dynamic grounding (data masking before send)\n- Toxicity detection\n- Audit log (GenAI audit objects)\n- Prompt injection defence\n\n[→ Trailhead: Einstein Trust Layer](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/agentforce-trust-layer-module)\n[→ Trailhead: Security Basics](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/security_basics)\n[→ [[einstein-trust-layer]]]\n[→ [[genai-audit-data-model]]]","x":1490,"y":-120,"width":260,"height":420},
		{"id":"g_byo_llm","type":"group","x":1480,"y":300,"width":280,"height":360,"color":"6","label":"BYO LLM (Open Connector)"},
		{"id":"n_byo_llm","type":"text","text":"## [BYO LLM](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.ai_llm_gateway_overview.htm&type=5)\n\nStandard LLMs available via Trust Layer LLM Gateway:\n\n- **OpenAI** (Azure OpenAI + OpenAI direct)\n- **Anthropic**\n- **Cohere**\n- **Any LLM** via Open Connector (custom HTTP endpoint)\n\n[→ Salesforce Help: LLM Gateway](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.ai_llm_gateway_overview.htm&type=5)","x":1490,"y":320,"width":260,"height":320},
		{"id":"g_datacloud","type":"group","x":360,"y":560,"width":1120,"height":560,"color":"4","label":"Data Cloud"},
		{"id":"n_data_streams","type":"text","text":"## [Data Streams](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_data_streams.htm&type=5)\n\nConnectors that ingest data from source systems into Data Cloud\n\n[→ Salesforce Help: Data Streams](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_data_streams.htm&type=5)","x":380,"y":580,"width":260,"height":160},
		{"id":"n_data_graphs","type":"text","text":"## [Data Graphs](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_data_graphs.htm&type=5)\n\nPre-computed entity graphs for low-latency real-time lookups\n\n[→ Salesforce Help: Data Graphs](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_data_graphs.htm&type=5)","x":380,"y":760,"width":260,"height":160},
		{"id":"n_c360_dmm","type":"text","text":"## [Customer 360 Data Model](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_data_model.htm&type=5)\n\nCanonical data model (DMO — Data Model Objects) that normalises ingested data across all sources\n\n[→ Salesforce Help: Data Model](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_data_model.htm&type=5)","x":660,"y":580,"width":280,"height":180},
		{"id":"n_vector_db","type":"text","text":"## [Vector DB / Search Indexes](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.data_cloud_search_index.htm&type=5)\n\nVector or Hybrid (Beta) search across embedded content — powers RAG retrieval via Retrievers\n\n[→ Salesforce Help: Search Indexes](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.data_cloud_search_index.htm&type=5)\n[→ Trailhead: Advanced RAG](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/advanced-rag-with-data-360-and-agentforce)","x":660,"y":780,"width":280,"height":240},
		{"id":"n_calc_insights","type":"text","text":"## [Calculated Insights](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_calculated_insights.htm&type=5)\n\nSQL-based metrics computed over unified profile data (e.g. LTV, churn score)\n\n[→ Salesforce Help: Calculated Insights](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_calculated_insights.htm&type=5)","x":960,"y":580,"width":260,"height":200},
		{"id":"n_ml_predictions","type":"text","text":"## [ML Predictions](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_ml_predictions.htm&type=5)\n\nEinstein Discovery-style predictive scores surfaced on unified profiles\n\n[→ Salesforce Help: ML Predictions](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_ml_predictions.htm&type=5)","x":960,"y":800,"width":260,"height":180},
		{"id":"n_segment","type":"text","text":"## [Einstein Segment Creation](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_segments.htm&type=5)\n\nAI-assisted natural-language segment builder on unified profiles\n\n[→ Salesforce Help: Segments](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_segments.htm&type=5)","x":1240,"y":580,"width":220,"height":200},
		{"id":"n_genai_audit","type":"text","text":"## [Einstein GenAI Audit & Feedback Data](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.ai_genai_audit_overview.htm&type=5)\n\n9 objects that capture every LLM request/response passing through the Trust Layer:\n- GenAIGatewayRequest · GenAIGatewayResponse\n- GenAIGeneration · GenAIGatewayRequestInternal\n- GenAIGatewayRequestTag · GenAIContentQuality\n- GenAIAppGeneration · GenAIFeedback · GenAIFeedbackDetail · GenAIContentCategory\n\nQueryable via SOQL, Data Cloud Reports, or JDBC (Tableau, CRMA, BI tools)\n\n[→ [[genai-audit-data-model]]]\n[→ Trailhead: Agentforce Analytics](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/agentforce-analytics-and-monitoring)","x":1240,"y":800,"width":220,"height":300},
		{"id":"g_sources","type":"group","x":-200,"y":1180,"width":1900,"height":380,"color":"6","label":"Source Systems (feed Data Cloud via Ingestion API / Data Streams)"},
		{"id":"n_files_unstructured","type":"text","text":"## Files (Unstructured Data)\n\nS3 · GCP · Azure storage\n\n[→ Salesforce Help: Unstructured Data](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_unstructured_data.htm&type=5)","x":-180,"y":1200,"width":220,"height":160},
		{"id":"n_experience_cloud","type":"text","text":"## [Experience Cloud](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.networks_overview.htm&type=5)\n\nSupport Forums — product views, community posts\n\n[→ Salesforce Help: Experience Cloud](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.networks_overview.htm&type=5)","x":-180,"y":1380,"width":220,"height":140},
		{"id":"n_websites","type":"text","text":"## Websites\n\nProduct Views tracked via Web SDK / Beacon\n\n[→ Salesforce Help: Web SDK](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_web_sdk.htm&type=5)","x":60,"y":1200,"width":200,"height":140},
		{"id":"n_mobile_apps","type":"text","text":"## Mobile Apps\n\nActivity and Geo data via Mobile SDK\n\n[→ Salesforce Help: Mobile SDK](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_mobile_sdk.htm&type=5)","x":60,"y":1360,"width":200,"height":140},
		{"id":"n_sales_org","type":"text","text":"## [Sales Org](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_salesforce_crm_connector.htm&type=5)\n\nAccount · Contact · Lead · Opportunity · **Knowledge** · Email\n\n[→ Salesforce CRM Connector](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_salesforce_crm_connector.htm&type=5)","x":280,"y":1200,"width":220,"height":160},
		{"id":"n_service_org","type":"text","text":"## [Service Org](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_salesforce_crm_connector.htm&type=5)\n\nAccount · Contact · Case · Entitlement · **Knowledge** · Email\n\n[→ Salesforce CRM Connector](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_salesforce_crm_connector.htm&type=5)","x":520,"y":1200,"width":220,"height":160},
		{"id":"n_other_orgs","type":"text","text":"## Other Orgs\n\nStandard & Custom Objects from additional Salesforce orgs\n\n[→ Salesforce CRM Connector](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_salesforce_crm_connector.htm&type=5)","x":760,"y":1200,"width":200,"height":160},
		{"id":"n_b2c","type":"text","text":"## [B2C Commerce](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_b2c_commerce_connector.htm&type=5)\n\nProduct Catalog · Product · Sales Order · Customer\n\n[→ B2C Commerce Connector](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_b2c_commerce_connector.htm&type=5)","x":980,"y":1200,"width":220,"height":160},
		{"id":"n_marketing","type":"text","text":"## [Marketing Cloud](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_mktng_cld_connector.htm&type=5)\n\nEngagement Data: Email · SMS · Mobile\n\n[→ Marketing Cloud Connector](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_mktng_cld_connector.htm&type=5)","x":1220,"y":1200,"width":220,"height":160},
		{"id":"n_byol","type":"text","text":"## BYOL (Bring Your Own Lake)\n\nSnowflake · Redshift · BigQuery · Databricks — federated query without full copy\n\n[→ Salesforce Help: BYOL](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_byol.htm&type=5)","x":1460,"y":1200,"width":220,"height":180},
		{"id":"n_byom","type":"text","text":"## BYOM (Bring Your Own Model)\n\nSageMaker · Vertex AI · BigQuery · Databricks — register external ML models in Einstein Studio\n\n[→ Salesforce Help: BYOM](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.einstein_studio_register_external_models.htm&type=5)","x":1700,"y":1200,"width":220,"height":200},
		{"id":"n_1p_systems","type":"text","text":"## 1P Systems\n\nFirst-party Salesforce products beyond core CRM (e.g. Field Service, Revenue Cloud)","x":1700,"y":1420,"width":180,"height":120},
		{"id":"n_3p_systems","type":"text","text":"## 3P Systems\n\nThird-party applications ingested via Ingestion API, MuleSoft connectors, or Data Streams\n\n[→ Salesforce Help: Ingestion API](https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=sf.c360_a_ingestion_api.htm&type=5)","x":1460,"y":1420,"width":220,"height":140}
	],
